  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/1627406615_9650949_ed29e96d8d2b991646868e7958bee034.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 25.68px; font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\">🚀</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 25.68px;\"> Get 10% Commissions on High-Quality Audio Products That Range From $39 - $2000+ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 25.68px; font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\">🎧</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Introducing Edifier - a pioneer in cutting-edge audio technology and design, committed to providing exceptional sound experiences for music enthusiasts and audiophiles worldwide.</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\">🌟</span> Brand Introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Edifier specializes in premium sound systems, headphones, and speakers that cater to a wide range of customers - from casual listeners to audio professionals. Our innovative products have garnered numerous international design awards and worldwide acclaim.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\">🎵</span> Product Descriptions:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our diverse product lineup includes:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. Bookshelf Speakers - Sleek and powerful, perfect for home entertainment or professional use.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. Bluetooth Speakers - Portable and versatile, delivering high-quality audio on-the-go.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3. Gaming Headsets - Immersive audio experiences for gamers, with superior comfort and durability.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4. Studio Monitors - Unmatched audio accuracy for professionals and audio enthusiasts.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">5. Home Theater Systems - Transforming living rooms into cinematic experiences.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji', sans-serif;\">🏆</span> USP (Unique Selling Points):</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. Unparalleled Sound Quality - Industry-leading audio technology for an exceptional listening experience.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. Stylish Design - A perfect blend of form and function, with a touch of elegance.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 15.693334px; font-size: 11pt; font-famil